@page "/about"

<PageTitle>JSONfn - About</PageTitle>

<div class="page info-page">

  <div class="info-content">
    <div class="info-heading">
      <h1>About JSONfn</h1>
      <img src="jsonfn.png" class="info-logo" />
    </div>

    <p class="info-lead">
      <strong>JSONfn</strong> is a browser-based developer tool for converting JSON
      data structures into strongly typed source code.
    </p>

    <p class="info-lead">
      The site is intended for software developers who work with APIs and other
      forms of structured data.
    </p>

    <p class="info-lead">
      JSONfn is an independent project developed and maintained by an independent developer.
    </p>

    <p class="info-lead">
      The project was created to reduce repetitive boilerplate code and make working
      with JSON data easier.
    </p>

    <p class="info-paragraph">
      For questions or feedback, you can contact us at
      <a href="mailto:hello@jsonfn.com" class="info-link">
        hello@jsonfn.com
      </a>.
    </p>

    <ul class="info-credits">
      <li>
        <p class="info-credit-note">
