                                  target="_blank">Dazzle Ui</a> in CC Attribution License via <a href="https://www.svgrepo.com/" class="link"
                                                                         target="_blank">SVG Repo</a>
        </p>
        <p class="info-credit-note">
          Vectors and icons by <a href="https://www.figma.com/community/file/1166831539721848736?ref=svgrepo.com"
                                  class="link" target="_blank">Solar Icons</a> in CC Attribution License via <a
          href="https://www.svgrepo.com/" class="link" target="_blank">SVG Repo</a>
        </p>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>

</div>
